## 2. Invariant Checklist

- [ ] All queries project explicit column lists (no unconstrained `*`).
- [ ] Outer `WHERE` clauses apply sargable predicates on partitioned keys.
- [ ] Table identifiers terminate in structural layer suffixes (`_dim`, `_fact`, `_met`).
- [ ] Column names terminate in ISO 11179 class words (`_id`, `_nm`, `_dt`, `_ts`, `_amt`, `_qty`, `_ind`, `_cd`).
- [ ] Code formatting has zero diffs against the canonical formatter configuration.
